  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Long Hair Ancestor dies still unable to forget the failed Space Escape Gu refined with Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable. His friend Immortal Yi Yan, a rank eight wisdom path Gu Immortal known for accurate one sentence predictions, expends fifty years of his life to deduce the future. The three would be two men and one woman. The third would solve the Space Escape Gu problem.",
      "chapters": [
        461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_long_hair_ancestor",
        "gu_space_escape_gu",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
        "char_immortal_yi_yan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Wondering whether Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s dream realm song is prophetic, Fang Yuan names the Prophecy of Three Venerables as an example of prophecy being a wisdom path specialty.",
      "chapters": [
        993
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The first is Spectral Soul Demon Venerable, the second is Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable, and the third is Great Dream Immortal Venerable. After Giant Sun Immortal Venerable, Spectral Soul Demon Venerable appeared. After the Demon Venerable died, a rank nine male Gu Immortal appeared in righteous path and was, as predicted, known as Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable. Paradise Earth Immortal Venerable is already dead; the prophecy is mostly complete, and only Great Dream Immortal Venerable, who has yet to be born, remains. Long Hair Ancestor dies and turns into a land spirit whose obsession is to see Great Dream Immortal Venerable solve that Gu problem, after which Lang Ya blessed land would belong to her.",
      "chapters": [
        461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
